<title>FRANCE: Metaleurop raises zinc price to 6,700 Ffr.</title>
<headline>Metaleurop raises zinc price to 6,700 Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metaleurop SA on Thursday raised its indicative zinc price to 6,700 francs per tonne, the company said.</p>
<p>The last change was to 6,240 francs per tonne on November 27.</p>
<p>Earlier Union Miniere SA subsidiary Union Miniere France raised its own indicative zinc price to 6,700 francs per tonne from 6,250 francs.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
